~ start
Greetings again, your highness. Thank you for defending us this long.
Every six nights we have the opportunity to expand our colony, with significant resistance.
do ui.tutorial.set_advisor_expression(Tutorial.STATE.PROUD)
To help you further defend, I've written you some rousing speeches to pick from.
You may activate these decrees at your discretion by clicking on them at certain times in the night for massive effects.
do ui.tutorial.set_advisor_expression(Tutorial.STATE.NORM)
Of course, your critters won't want to hear the same thing every night, so there's some cooldown.
do ui.tutorial.set_advisor_expression(Tutorial.STATE.PROUD)
Please use these wisely to improve your defense at key moments.
do ui.tutorial.set_advisor_expression(Tutorial.STATE.HAPPY)
That is all I have to tell you. Thank you for listening to me. Farewell, your highness.
=> END